  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.691 Piscataqua River. There is established a “no wake” area on the Piscataqua River in the city of Dover from the southerly point of Lots L0108-0000/L0049-C00001 to a northerly point of Lots L0098-C00000/L0101-000000.\n\nSource. #13200, EXEMPT, eff 5-6-21",
